s come before the packet so the routine is taught twice with the teacher before a student runs it alone (the packet stands alone, STANDARD.md section 3). Readiness items in the last ten minutes of unit 1's respond day: placing a job on the cluster map and reading a dated figure (the 14 g8-clu rows and 14 first-look sub-cluster rows, last used in Exploration units 2 to 6), a percent and a rate (`m7-percent-problems`, `m7-unit-rate-fractions`, `m7-compare-populations`, grade 7, three grades back) and a public budget line where Public Service and Safety is a shared cluster (`ss8-public-budget`, grade 8). Retrieval inside the first field task that uses it: `alg1-data-displays` (Algebra I, the year before). | Candidate: per block, one unseen item per sub-cluster from its data sheet (a rate, a percent, a table read with its year); for the packet, the same from the student's own cluster, from a bank of all 14. | Every section or packet step on Behavioral and Mental Health, Emergency Response, Judicial Systems or Public Safety carries health's steps for when a student tells you something (docs/courses/health/APPROACH.md) on its teacher page; every case is invented and non-graphic, and no student is asked about their own or a family member's health, record or experience. The military is one real route with its costs and returns, from dated federal pages, never recruiting material; no recruiter material on a student page, and the school's own policy governs recruiter visits. Resource Extraction and Water Systems sit in live public disputes: the work and dated facts from more than one side, no verdict; students' own views on environment and resources are respected and never graded; Environmental Protection is a needed field, taught like any other. Regulation shows rules as jobs and tasks, no verdict on a policy or party. Investments and Banking use invented clients and businesses; no advice about a student's own money (Economics). Safety (days.csv words): "The bracket test uses card and coins only, seated at the table; coins are counted out and back in; five minutes of clean-up close the session. Drone, lighting, machinery, equipment and vehicle tasks are paper plans only; no flight, rigging, ladder, live power or machine use. The dilution series is on paper with no biological materials. The food science batch sheet has no tasting unless the school's food safety and allergy policy allows it. Where a school adds soil or seeds: a bagged growing medium, gloves and hand washing after." Tools: a dated job profile and an outlook figure reader (shared screen, paper path); Curio Class writes the 14 dated data sheets, the 72 field task sheets, the course's task template, the 14 packets with their check-in lines and the invented data sets, logs, tickets, cards and cases. Cost, class of 30, provisional: printing about 1,900 pages (two shared blocks at about 20 pages a student, one packet at about 25), about $95; card stock and school coins, $0 to $10. Sensitivity read: the six sensitive sub-clusters and their communities in all 14 packets and the field task sheets (the agent first studies the federal defense department's own published service-commitment pages beside veterans' organizations' published guidance for schools for the military route; tribal nations' own published workforce and land-management pages for land, water and resource work; disability-led organizations' published employment pages), and health's disclosure steps. |
